# Root `.env` is optional for this repo.
#
# Language list for Next.js + Sanity Studio lives in Git:
#   packages/languages/src/index.ts  →  package `@repo/languages`
# Web and Studio are often deployed separately; they do not share one host `.env`.
# Define secrets per app: `web/.env.local`, `studio/.env` (see each package’s `.env.example`).
